'''Nasi-Go-Round''' (ナシゴ・レン, ''Nashigo・Ren'', '''Nasigo-Ren''') is the 34th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 83rd sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. Most stages here rely on a combination of few, powerful enemies, rather than spam.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter is a little harder than the previous one. [[Kuala Lum-Pool]] will probably be the hardest for most players, but [[Khao Man Guys]] may end up being the hardest without [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Master Uril]] or an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can effectively stall the three [[Relic Bun-Bun]]s.
{{LegendDiff|130|170|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Mr. Mer]]: A tough [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy with a 100% chance to create Lv.3 [[Mini-Wave]]s. Similar to [[Kory]] or [[Dober P.D]], but with more range and less pushing power.

